   "source": [
    "# Service Access — Silver\n",
    "Water, electricity and household internet access · 2021–2025.\n",
    "\n",
    "Run all cells in order. Set job maximum concurrent runs to **1**; use one writer across all jobs and keep Bronze unchanged during this run. IDs start at **4,000,001** and existing IDs remain unchanged. Missing values stay NULL; omitted observations are retained.\n",
    "\n",
    "National records are separate from regional records. Percentages with different units must remain separate. Region codes align labels only: verify geographic boundaries before joining to budgets or GRDP (including NIR and BARMM/Sulu). Source notes remain available in Bronze; unverified missing reasons stay NULL."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {},
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "a711f13e-e64b-4b35-9931-d8f0babcafd7",
     "showTitle": false,
     "tableResultSettingsMap": {},
     "title": ""
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "## 1. Clean Bronze\n",
    "Trim text, parse numbers and select the three measures."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 0,
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {
      "byteLimit": 2048000,
      "rowLimit": 10000
     },
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "1793e676-dac9-42bd-ba37-f78bcba94e3d",
     "showTitle": false,
     "tableResultSettingsMap": {},
     "title": ""
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%sql\n",
    "SET TIME ZONE 'UTC';\n",
    "\n",
    "CREATE OR REPLACE TEMP VIEW service_access_clean AS\n",
    "SELECT\n",
    "    NULLIF(TRIM(country), '') AS country,\n",
    "    TRIM(year) AS year_raw,\n",
    "    CASE WHEN TRIM(year) RLIKE '^[0-9]{4}$'\n",
    "         THEN TRY_CAST(TRIM(year) AS INT) END AS year,\n",
    "    CASE TRIM(indicator)\n",
    "        WHEN 'At least basic drinking-water access' THEN 'Water'\n",
    "        WHEN 'Electricity access' THEN 'Electricity'\n",
    "        WHEN 'Internet access at home' THEN 'Internet'\n",
    "    END AS service,\n",
    "    TRIM(indicator) AS service_measure,\n",
    "    NULLIF(TRIM(region), '') AS source_region,\n",
    "    NULLIF(TRIM(breakdown_type), '') AS breakdown_type,\n",
    "    NULLIF(TRIM(breakdown_value), '') AS breakdown_value,\n",
    "    NULLIF(TRIM(value), '') AS value_raw,\n",
    "    TRY_CAST(NULLIF(TRIM(value), '') AS DECIMAL(18,10)) AS value,\n",
    "    NULLIF(TRIM(unit), '') AS unit,\n",
    "    CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS missing_reason,\n",
    "    NULLIF(TRIM(source), '') AS source,\n",
    "    NULLIF(TRIM(_run_id), '') AS run_id,\n",
    "    _rescued_data\n",
    "FROM pondolens.dev_bronze.service_access\n",
    "WHERE TRIM(indicator) IN (\n",
    "    'At least basic drinking-water access',\n",
    "    'Electricity access',\n",
    "    'Internet access at home'\n",
    ");"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {},
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "05e5d6d4-9d6a-4e46-bf15-ea7096ae5812",
     "showTitle": false,
     "tableResultSettingsMap": {},
     "title": ""
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "## 2. Map regions\n",
    "Use the same names and codes as GRDP. National uses PHL."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 0,
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {
      "byteLimit": 2048000,
      "rowLimit": 10000
     },
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "95eacb74-da36-4b8d-aab8-dfbc7db79e18",
     "showTitle": false,
     "tableResultSettingsMap": {},
     "title": ""
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%sql\n",
    "CREATE OR REPLACE TEMP VIEW service_access_region_map AS\n",
    "SELECT * FROM VALUES\n",
    "    ('BARMM', 'Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao', 'BARMM'),\n",
    "    ('CAR', 'Cordillera Administrative Region', 'CAR'),\n",
    "    ('MIMAROPA', 'MIMAROPA Region', 'IVB'),\n",
    "    ('NCR', 'National Capital Region', 'NCR'),\n",
    "    ('National', 'Philippines', 'PHL'),\n",
    "    ('Region I (Ilocos Region)', 'Ilocos Region', 'I'),\n",
    "    ('Region II (Cagayan Valley)', 'Cagayan Valley', 'II'),\n",
    "    ('Region III (Central Luzon)', 'Central Luzon', 'III'),\n",
    "    ('Region IV-A (CALABARZON)', 'CALABARZON', 'IVA'),\n",
    "    ('Region V (Bicol Region)', 'Bicol Region', 'V'),\n",
    "    ('Region VI (Western Visayas)', 'Western Visayas', 'VI'),\n",
    "    ('Region VII (Central Visayas)', 'Central Visayas', 'VII'),\n",
    "    ('Region VIII (Eastern Visayas)', 'Eastern Visayas', 'VIII'),\n",
    "    ('Region IX (Zamboanga Peninsula)', 'Zamboanga Peninsula', 'IX'),\n",
    "    ('Region X (Northern Mindanao)', 'Northern Mindanao', 'X'),\n",
    "    ('Region XI (Davao Region)', 'Davao Region', 'XI'),\n",
    "    ('Region XII (SOCCSKSARGEN)', 'SOCCSKSARGEN', 'XII'),\n",
    "    ('Region XIII (Caraga)', 'Caraga', 'XIII')\n",
    "AS mapping(source_region, region, region_code);\n",
    "\n",
    "CREATE OR REPLACE TEMP VIEW service_access_prepared AS\n",
    "SELECT s.*, m.region, m.region_code\n",
    "FROM service_access_clean s\n",
    "LEFT JOIN service_access_region_map m\n",
    "    ON s.source_region = m.source_region\n",
    "WHERE s.year BETWEEN 2021 AND 2025;"
   ]
  },
