    "## 8. Publish access views\n",
    "Gold reads available values. Missing observations remain in Silver for review.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 0,
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {
      "byteLimit": 2048000,
